<metadata><name>Galičica trail H-9</name><desc>H-9 is one of Galičica National Park's easier and shorter hiking trails. It runs 2.2 km from Peshtani to the MTB-6 junction, climbing about 231 m and descending 0 m in the direction drawn, between 697 m and 930 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/h-9/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
